# PROJECT ORGANIZATION CLEANUP SPRINT
## End-to-End Project Structure Reorganization

---

## Sprint Metadata
- **Type**: Cleanup / Reorganization / Consolidation
- **Risk Level**: Low (no code changes, only file operations)
- **Estimated Duration**: 3-4 sessions
- **Completion Date**: [TO BE FILLED]
- **Dependencies**: None (self-contained cleanup)

---

## REGRESSION PREVENTION CHECKLIST (Execute First)

**Before any file operations:**
- [ ] Run `git status` → verify clean working directory
- [ ] Run `npm run build` → verify build passes (baseline)
- [ ] Run `npm run test` → verify tests pass (baseline)
- [ ] Run `npm run lint` → verify no lint errors (baseline)
- [ ] Create git branch: `git checkout -b project-organization-cleanup`

**After each scope contract:**
- [ ] Verify no broken imports (IDE check)
- [ ] Verify build still passes
- [ ] Verify tests still pass

---

## SCOPE CONTRACT 1: Root-Level File Cleanup

**Goal**: Eliminate root-level bloat - duplicate files, empty files, and orphaned artifacts

**In Scope**:
- Delete confirmed duplicate files (content identical)
- Delete empty/0-byte files
- Remove git diff artifacts (regenerable)
- Delete orphaned root-level test files
- Consolidate multiple README variants

**Out of Scope**:
- Any file content modification (content changes = different sprint)
- Code files that are imported/used
- `.windsurfrules` (sacred - untouched)
- Any `.env` files

---

### SCOPE CONTRACT 1: DoD Layers

#### PASS 1 — Duplicate File Identification & Verification
**DoD 1.1**: Inventory all exact duplicates identified in audit:
  - `_project/COMMANDS/Audit daily performance copy.md` vs `Audit daily performance.md`
  - `public/icons/carousel_dot_active copy.svg` vs `carousel_dot_active.svg`
  - All 0-byte `.windsurf/workflows/` files (audit.md, comi.md, research.md, scripts.md)
**DoD 1.2**: Verify duplicates are 100% byte-identical (hash comparison)
**DoD 1.3**: Document decision: keep original, delete copy
**DoD 1.4**: Create backup list of all files to delete

#### PASS 2 — Empty File Deletion
**DoD 2.1**: Delete `github-workflows` (0 bytes at root)
**DoD 2.2**: Delete `.windsurf/workflows/audit.md` (0 bytes)
**DoD 2.3**: Delete `.windsurf/workflows/comi.md` (0 bytes)
**DoD 2.4**: Delete `.windsurf/workflows/research.md` (0 bytes)
**DoD 2.5**: Delete `.windsurf/workflows/scripts.md` (0 bytes)
**DoD 2.6**: Verify each deletion - file no longer exists

#### PASS 3 — Duplicate Content Deletion
**DoD 3.1**: Delete `_project/COMMANDS/Audit daily performance copy.md`
**DoD 3.2**: Delete `public/icons/carousel_dot_active copy.svg` (verify not referenced in code)
**DoD 3.3**: Delete `test-vfs-simple.js` (keep `.mjs` version - verify in scripts)
**DoD 3.4**: Verify deletions - files no longer exist

#### PASS 4 — Artifact Cleanup
**DoD 4.1**: Move `_git_diff.txt` → `_project/_archive/git-diffs/`
**DoD 4.2**: Move `_git_diff_sprint.txt` → `_project/_archive/git-diffs/`
**DoD 4.3**: Delete `SUMMARY.md` (minimal content, superseded by other docs)
**DoD 4.4**: Consolidate README variants - keep only:
  - `README.md` (main project README)
  - `README_OMS.md` (if Order Management System is active)
  - Move `README_TEMPLATE.md` → `_handbook/07-appendices/`
  - Move `README_ROOT_ENTRY_TEMPLATE.md` → `_handbook/07-appendices/`

