## SCOPE CONTRACT 2: Command Documentation Consolidation

**Goal**: Eliminate triplication - single source of truth for command workflows

**In Scope**:
- Consolidate 3 locations into 1 authoritative location
- Standardize naming convention (kebab-case)
- Remove versioned duplicates (v1, v2)
- Preserve all valuable workflow logic

**Out of Scope**:
- `.windsurfrules` (sacred - untouched)
- Content modification (merge as-is, improve in separate sprint)
- Deleting workflows entirely (reorganize only)

---

### SCOPE CONTRACT 2: DoD Layers

#### PASS 1 — Inventory & Compare
**DoD 1.1**: List all files in 3 locations:
  - `_project/COMMANDS/` (13 files)
  - `_handbook/03-commands/` (5 files)
  - `.windsurf/workflows/` (9 files, 4 empty already deleted in SC1)
**DoD 1.2**: Map duplicates across locations:
  - Implement: `_project/COMMANDS/Implement_v1.md`, `Implement_v2.md` ↔ `_handbook/03-commands/implement.md` ↔ `.windsurf/workflows/implement.md`
  - Test: `_project/COMMANDS/Tests for codebase.md` ↔ `_handbook/03-commands/test.md` ↔ `.windsurf/workflows/test.md`
  - Commit: `_project/COMMANDS/PastePad.md` ↔ `_handbook/03-commands/commit.md` ↔ `.windsurf/workflows/commit.md`
  - Debug: `_project/COMMANDS/[none]` ↔ `_handbook/03-commands/debug.md` ↔ `.windsurf/workflows/debug.md`
  - Sprint: `_project/COMMANDS/[none]` ↔ `_handbook/03-commands/sprint.md` ↔ `.windsurf/workflows/sprint.md`
  - Audit: `_project/COMMANDS/Audit*.md` (5 files) ↔ others [none]
**DoD 1.3**: Content comparison - identify which has latest/most complete version
**DoD 1.4**: Decision: Authoritative location = `_handbook/03-commands/`

#### PASS 2 — Consolidate to Authoritative Location
**DoD 2.1**: Merge Implement versions:
  - Keep `_handbook/03-commands/implement.md` (target)
  - Review `Implement_v2.md` for any unique content → append to target if valuable
  - Delete `_project/COMMANDS/Implement_v1.md`
  - Delete `_project/COMMANDS/Implement_v2.md`
**DoD 2.2**: Merge Test versions:
  - Keep `_handbook/03-commands/test.md` (target)
  - Review `Tests for codebase.md` for any unique content → append if valuable
  - Delete `_project/COMMANDS/Tests for codebase.md`
**DoD 2.3**: Merge Commit versions:
  - Review `PastePad.md` content
  - If valuable unique content: append to `_handbook/03-commands/commit.md`
  - Delete `_project/COMMANDS/PastePad.md`
**DoD 2.4**: Move unique Audit commands:
  - Move `_project/COMMANDS/Audit codebase.md` → `_handbook/03-commands/audit-codebase.md`
  - Move `_project/COMMANDS/Audit daily performance.md` → `_handbook/03-commands/audit-daily-performance.md`
  - Move `_project/COMMANDS/Audit design.md` → `_handbook/03-commands/audit-design.md`
  - Move `_project/COMMANDS/Audit performance.md` → `_handbook/03-commands/audit-performance.md`
  - Move `_project/COMMANDS/Audit performance simple.md` → `_handbook/03-commands/audit-performance-simple.md`
  - Move `_project/COMMANDS/Design audit browser chat.md` → `_handbook/03-commands/design-audit-browser-chat.md`
  - Move `_project/COMMANDS/Featured_Animation_Handoff_for_Opus.md` → `_handbook/03-commands/featured-animation-handoff.md`
**DoD 2.5**: Delete `.windsurf/workflows/` duplicates (already sync with handbook):
  - Delete `.windsurf/workflows/commit.md`
  - Delete `.windsurf/workflows/debug.md`
  - Delete `.windsurf/workflows/implement.md`
  - Delete `.windsurf/workflows/sprint.md`
  - Delete `.windsurf/workflows/test.md`

#### PASS 3 — Cleanup Source Location
**DoD 3.1**: Verify `_project/COMMANDS/` is empty
**DoD 3.2**: Delete `_project/COMMANDS/` directory
**DoD 3.3**: Verify `.windsurf/workflows/` has only non-command files (or is empty)

