## SCOPE CONTRACT 3: Test File Organization

**Goal**: Single unified test structure - no scattered test files

**In Scope**:
- Consolidate 5+ test locations into unified `tests/` hierarchy
- Standardize naming (kebab-case)
- Preserve all test logic
- Create clear separation: unit/integration/e2e/component

**Out of Scope**:
- Test content modification (reorganize only)
- Deleting actual test logic (relocate only)
- `node_modules/` tests

---

### SCOPE CONTRACT 3: DoD Layers

#### PASS 1 — Inventory All Test Locations
**DoD 1.1**: Document `tests/` structure (existing organization)
**DoD 1.2**: Document `tests_e2e/` structure
**DoD 1.3**: Document `app/(store)/basket/__tests__/` content
**DoD 1.4**: Document `catalogue_test/` content
**DoD 1.5**: Document root test files: `test-vfs-simple.mjs`, `test-unroll.mjs`
**DoD 1.6**: Document `scripts/product-vfs-mapper/test-missing-logging.mjs`

#### PASS 2 — Create Unified Structure
**DoD 2.1**: Ensure `tests/` has clear subdirectories:
  - `tests/unit/` - Unit tests (Vitest)
  - `tests/integration/` - Integration tests
  - `tests/e2e/` - End-to-end tests (Playwright)
  - `tests/component/` - Component tests (Playwright CT)
  - `tests/regression/` - Regression test suite
**DoD 2.2**: Move `tests_e2e/` → `tests/e2e/` (merge with existing `tests/e2e/`)
**DoD 2.3**: Move `app/(store)/basket/__tests__/` → `tests/component/basket/`
**DoD 2.4**: Move `catalogue_test/` → `tests/integration/catalogue/` or `tests/unit/catalogue/` (assess content)
**DoD 2.5**: Move root test files:
  - `test-vfs-simple.mjs` → `tests/unit/vfs/` (already exists, check for duplicate)
  - `test-unroll.mjs` → `tests/unit/vfs/` (verify not duplicate of existing)
**DoD 2.6**: Move `scripts/product-vfs-mapper/test-missing-logging.mjs` → `tests/unit/vfs/` OR keep in scripts if it's a utility (assess)

#### PASS 3 — Cleanup Empty Locations
**DoD 3.1**: Delete `tests_e2e/` directory after move verified
**DoD 3.2**: Delete `app/(store)/basket/__tests__/` directory after move verified
**DoD 3.3**: Delete `catalogue_test/` directory after move verified

#### PASS 4 — Naming Standardization
**DoD 4.1**: Rename `tests/catalogue-split.test.js` → `tests/unit/catalogue/catalogue-split.test.ts` (upgrade to TS)
**DoD 4.2**: Rename `tests_e2e/accept_E2E_REAL_API.test.ts` → `tests/e2e/address/accept-e2e-real-api.test.ts` (kebab-case)
**DoD 4.3**: Standardize all test files to kebab-case convention
**DoD 4.4**: Standardize extensions: `.test.ts` for unit/integration, `.spec.ts` for e2e/component

